                "about": {
                    "image": {
                        "src": "https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-creatureinthewell-flightschoolstudio-s2-1200x1600-a567d45a0aa1.jpg",
                        "_type": "Diesel Image"
                    },
                    "developerAttribution": "Flight School Studio",
                    "_type": "Diesel Product About",
                    "publisherAttribution": "MWM Interactive ",
                    "description": "Creature in the Well is a top-down, pinball-inspired, hack-and-slash dungeon crawler. As the last remaining BOT-C unit, venture deep into a desert mountain to restore power to an ancient facility, haunted by a desperate Creature. Uncover and upgrade powerful gear in order to free the city of Mirage from a deadly sandstorm.\n\n# Key Features \n\n- Pinball with swords: Charge up energy orbs, then bounce and ricochet them to reactivate dormant machinery and stop the sandstorm.\n\n- Defeat the Creature: Escape the many challenges set by the Creature and confront it in intricate, skillful battles.\n\n- Dungeon-crawler: Delve deeper into the mountain as you unlock eight hand-crafted dungeons, each filled with unique gameplay themes, unlockables, and secrets to uncover.\n\n- Over 20 unique items: Customize your playstyle with upgradeable weapons and clothing that change how you play the game.",
                    "shortDescription": "As the last remaining BOT-C unit, venture deep into a desert mountain to restore power to an ancient facility, haunted by a desperate Creature. Uncover and upgrade powerful gear in order to free the city of Mirage from a deadly sandstorm.",
